{"title": "Umbral Attack", "pageid": 28947, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Umbral_Attack", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Umbral Attack</b> is a passive feature that adds necrotic damage to the user's weapon attacks.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Your weapon attacks deal an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">1d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Necrotic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> damage. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Justiciar_Gauntlets_(Rare)\" title=\"Dark Justiciar Gauntlets (Rare)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/ff/Dark_Justiciar_Gauntlets_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Dark_Justiciar_Gauntlets_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/ff/Dark_Justiciar_Gauntlets_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Dark_Justiciar_Gauntlets_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/ff/Dark_Justiciar_Gauntlets_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Dark_Justiciar_Gauntlets_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/ff/Dark_Justiciar_Gauntlets_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Dark_Justiciar_Gauntlets_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/ff/Dark_Justiciar_Gauntlets_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Justiciar_Gauntlets_(Rare)\" title=\"Dark Justiciar Gauntlets (Rare)\">Dark Justiciar Gauntlets</a></span></li><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Justiciar_Gauntlets_(Uncommon)\" title=\"Dark Justiciar Gauntlets (Uncommon)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/ff/Dark_Justiciar_Gauntlets_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Dark_Justiciar_Gauntlets_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/ff/Dark_Justiciar_Gauntlets_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Dark_Justiciar_Gauntlets_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/ff/Dark_Justiciar_Gauntlets_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Dark_Justiciar_Gauntlets_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/ff/Dark_Justiciar_Gauntlets_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Dark_Justiciar_Gauntlets_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/ff/Dark_Justiciar_Gauntlets_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Justiciar_Gauntlets_(Uncommon)\" title=\"Dark Justiciar Gauntlets (Uncommon)\">Dark Justiciar Gauntlets</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Umbral Attack also works on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/20px-Throw_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/30px-Throw_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/40px-Throw_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp/20px-Throw_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Throw_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">Throw</a> attacks.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200257\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.044 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1751/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 17033/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4536/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.016/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 969274/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   43.731      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   43.731      1 -total\n 36.69%   16.046      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 32.00%   13.995      2 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 29.52%   12.910      2 Template:MdRarityItem\n 24.88%   10.879    